    "text": "IT is hereby noti\ufb01 ed that the annual Lenten season of Hiniduma Calvary Shrine (St.Ann\u2019s Church) Located within the two Grama Niladhari Divisions of Hiniduma South and Malhathawa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thawalama in the District of Galle, Southern Province will be held during the period from 18th February 2026 to 5th April 2026 as per the regulations made under the Extraordinary Gazette Noti\ufb01 cation No. 2057/33 dated 09.02.2018 of the democratic socialist republic of Sri Lanka in terms of the Section 2 of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Cap. 175)..",
